{{also|Rauchern}}
==German==

===Etymology===
15th century, extension of obsolete {{m|de|räuchen}}, from {{der|de|gmh|röuchen}}, byform of {{m|gmh|rouchen}}, whence modern {{cog|de|rauchen|t=to smoke}}, which see for more. Both from {{der|de|gem-pro|*raukijaną}}. {{surface analysis|de|Rauch|-ern}}. Compare {{cog|lb|reecheren}}, {{cog|hrx|reichre}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʁɔʏ̯çɐn/}}
* {{audio|de|De-räuchern.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# to [[smoke]] (food), to [[cure]]
# to [[fumigate]] (a place) {{q|now chiefly with [[incense]], otherwise use {{m|de|ausräuchern}}}}

